+## Stage E K2 load-shedding discrepancy tables
+
+Added a focused Stage E K2 GridFM load-shedding discrepancy summary for
+`main_results/r11`. This intentionally excludes DC approximation rows and
+TH/AH heuristic rows.
+
+Reason for exclusion:
+
+- DC rows have exact DC load-service accounting. Their `L_shed_cmd` and
+  `L_shed_hybrid` fields represent the same DC service quantity, while
+  `L_shed_gridfm_raw` and `L_shed_gridfm_effective` are not meaningful.
+- TH/AH rows are heuristic/baseline comparison points, not GridFM-optimized
+  continuous recourse rows. Including them in a command-vs-GridFM discrepancy
+  table would mix decision-generation semantics.
+- The table is meant to isolate the Stage E K2 GridFM issue: the difference
+  between commanded load shedding and GridFM-implied/hybrid load shedding after
+  the selected topology and recourse are evaluated.
+
+Generated tables:
+
+```text
+main_results/r11/tables/stage_e_k2_load_shed_discrepancy_main_results.csv
+main_results/r11/tables/stage_e_k2_load_shed_discrepancy_summary_by_rho_lambda.csv
+main_results/r11/tables/stage_e_k2_load_shed_discrepancy_summary_overall.csv
+main_results/r11/tables/stage_e_k2_load_shed_discrepancy_metadata.json
+```
+
+The primary clean visual mirrors the exact revised-load heuristic comparison
+methodology from:
+
+```text
+load_shed_cmd_gridfm_hybrid_by_method.png
+```
+
+but filters to Stage E K2 only:
+
+```text
+main_results/r11/plots/summary/load_shed_cmd_gridfm_hybrid_stage_e_k2_only.png
+```
+
+Overall summary across the 50 Stage E K2 selected rows:
+
+```text
+mean L_shed_cmd:              0.0671
+mean L_shed_gridfm_raw:       0.0603
+mean L_shed_gridfm_effective: 0.2619
+mean L_shed_hybrid:           0.2143
+
+mean(raw - cmd):              -0.0068
+mean(effective - cmd):         0.1948
+mean(hybrid - cmd):            0.1471
+max_abs(hybrid - cmd):         0.3820
+```
+
+Refresh command:
+
+```text
+python experiments/test/wildfire_tests/stage_i_dc_comparison/run_stage_e_load_shed_discrepancy_summary.py
+```
+
